    <symbol id="pin"><path d="M 0 0 C -12 -20 -34 -38 -34 -62 A 34 34 0 1 1 34 -62 C 34 -38 12 -20 0 0 Z" fill="#ff4b55" stroke="#ffffff" sw="4"/><circle y="-62" r="12" fill="#ffffff"/></symbol>
    <mask id="ss-logo"><circle x="-330" r="90" fill="#ffffff"/><circle x="-330" r="40" fill="#0b0d14"/><text x="-200" size="170" weight="800" fill="#ffffff" text="NOVA"/></mask>
    <linear id="ss-bar" x1="-120" y1="0" x2="120" y2="0"><stop at="0" color="#ffffff" opacity="0"/><stop at="0.5" color="#ffffff" opacity="1"/><stop at="1" color="#ffffff" opacity="0"/></linear>
    <clip id="sp-clip"><path d="M 585 220 L 691 170 L 872 180 L 1036 195 L 1200 205 L 1306 260 L 1405 260 L 1610 300 L 1610 350 L 1519 410 L 1421 440 L 1347 540 L 1323 600 L 1364 660 L 1306 710 L 1282 780 L 1208 810 L 1175 870 L 1060 870 L 978 880 L 888 940 L 831 860 L 740 820 L 773 740 L 749 690 L 781 640 L 732 570 L 781 510 L 790 440 L 839 380 L 806 345 L 683 355 L 617 340 L 585 260 Z"/></clip>
